<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:34 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Phi-e-rơ thưq yưk</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Phi-e-rơ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pe</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Phi-e-rơ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Phi-e-rơ, adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, atăq ka khơl manih jah rơơlh katul khơl manih riirh xangưưy dêh pachaay loch aduq đom dêh Bông, Ga-la-ti, Kap-ba-đôk, A-si ji Bi-thi-ni, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />tyauq varơuq xet adroyq ku Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, bơyh varơuq xôq đêh vlôh ku Lôôk Phool Hiel ka varơuq tameng tyauq ji varơuq xa'nhơyh vahaap ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Apôôy xiin vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol jah 'ngưng athêêp galơh galaay tol oh ay.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Đangq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk ji Vaq ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Kơy xatyauq xuum biit angơuq kôt galơh ku Kadraq, heq tađôôy đơơu haay muut đom xuum takôô gamưh riirh gamưh varơuq riirh hlê ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu xing aduq kaxêêt, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />wih xuq muuyq kơ ngiip leh hư hlơp, leh klơl 'yêq ji leh rook hlơp, heq jah jư 'yo tol plêêk ka oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />laa deng ka khơl adro gamưh xuum tuôq, jah jư 'yo bơyh taay yaak Kơy Plêêk ka varơuq wơơt xok, laa varơuq ralauq 'miêh xôq jah kahnoq vlôh đom kađơơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Gamưh anưq, oh ay thier hlah hlaak, long ka juneq duh pheq chiuq hlu rơu muuyq jơy đom 'ngưng varơuq thưh thek <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />xôq ka varơuq dưk xanưk truh xuum tuôq ku oh ay — varơuq quiq iaq vajang, laa thưq biq hư hek đơu măn chiuq thưh 'yo bơơn ôôlh — e hnoq jah 'yo nhonq xôq taway truh varơuq ayuôôt laat, tađnah tađnaak ji vado đom varơuq rama vlôh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kơy đơu oh ay xung xiaq ju koq hloq, juneq long leh hloq Kadraq bơh vii tuôq gamưh aduq Kadraq, lunưq oh ay hlah hlaak dii xuum hlah be ik đnooy ji jah viik galaay tađnah tađnaak, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />nhonq xok raak play aduq xuum tuôq ku oh ay, nưq laa varơuq wơơt xok phool hiel. <verse eid="1PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Khơl hnhư hlit heq axek 'yo ji arơơk 'yo thier ki truh varơuq wơơt xok neq, nưq laa khơl adro heq đnooy adroyq truh vanong plêêk deng ka oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />tuôôy axek 'yo truh adro leq long tuôôy leq đơu Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đom oot 'miêh heq kahnoq vlôh, ăm xet adroyq truh varơuq pơơl jiq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji varơuq tađnah tađnaak atêq kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Varơuq heq jah kahnoq vlôh ka oot, nưq laa oot 'miêh leh hơu varơuq ka kadih oot, bơh ka oh ay, truh kaluh varơuq đơu juneq heq jah đnooy vlôh ka oh ay xing khơl manih padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ka oh ay gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel jah patăk xing plêêk — đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq nưq, khơl yaak plêêk kung trôôch xung 'yo hloq.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Vii anưq, bơơn kach ralauq xôq xuum biit oh ay đaji hnoq hnek katêêk, jư talăng jăk, dayh xôq xaleep takôô gamưh muut vanong plêêk jah xagook truh ka oh ay đom varơuq rama vlôh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Đaji koot xau xet tameng apok, leh dơơp tyauq kaluh xuum hmưch trôôch adroyq hơq đom varơuq koq hlolh xet ku oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />wih hlê, dang đaji Kơy heq tawooyh taayh oh ay laa vah, kadih oh ay kung pheq jah yuôôr vah đom dêq hloay kach xa măn ku oh ay. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Vii e apok valơk: “Khơl koot hnoq yuôôr vah vii Gô laa vah.” <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ji atoh oh ay taayh Kơy xưh xadrah kach leh bing kơyq xatyauq kông varơuq ku tôôy adro laa “Vaq”, yôôych dayh riirh dii xuum kuh yôq đom kawat măn đơ đơơy neq ku oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />vii xet đaneq be aalq gamưh kaluh thư e hnoq hư hek đaji baak long vajang đơu oh ay heq jah wơơt vlôh klơlh đơơy riirh be raa kajoq ku oh ay xing mo kơy xôq hlê, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />bơh laa gamưh vahaap quiq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đaji trưưu koot leh e hlêêl tachoot ji leh klơl 'yêq, <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />heq jah đinq adroyq tuôôy panưk jêêk plêêk vari, bơh jah kahnoq vlôh đom đơơy xanưm lôôch dik neq vii kơq oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />laa khơl adro gamưh Kadraq tuôq aduq Kơy Plêêk, Kơy heq khienq Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt ji kahniq tađnah tađnaak ka Kadraq, xôq xuum tuôq ji xuum takôô gamưh ku oh ay măn đom Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Tuôôy heq pa xarêh phool hiel oh ay gamưh varơuq tameng tyauq varơuq dik wih truh xuum xiaq oh ay dong dik, oh ay dayh xung xiaq mamuuyq kach dêq paraat dii xuum pa xarêh, <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />vii heq jah tađôôy đơơu, be aalq xing adrek e hnoq hư hek, đơu xing adrek leh e hnoq hư hek, gamưh apok hloay riirh ji măn miet ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Bơyh vii:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">“Tôôy xăk xamơk dang đaji rek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ji tôôy tađnah tađnaak ku ni dang đaji raak rek.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Rek kateh, ji raak ruh,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />bơh apok Lôôk măn truh đơơy đơơy.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Nưq laa Hêêl Kaxay heq jah padoh taboon ka oh ay.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Lunưq, tuôôy heq ka'lăk tôôy varơuq xơk tauq, tôôy varơuq pa ôôh lar ji xuum klaak pa ôôh, varơuq 'yarơ kung tôôy apok đnooy xơuq, <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />yôôych đaji khơl oh de đơơu pa iir, dayh thaal trôôch daak tôh thiêêng liêng xarêh xaraat, xôq gamưh đnư oh ay e hnoq jah dơơp ka kôt tok dong truh varơuq wơơt xok, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />atoh oh ay heq nhemq xet đaneq Lôôk kaxay tamaq, <verse eid="1PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />tuôôy truh jeq dii Kadraq, laa kuk phơu riirh, heq biq manih oot ka'lăk vlôh, bơh laay laa varơuq rơơlh xok quiq jaq adroyq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />ji kadih oh ay, dang đaji kaluh kuk phơu riirh, đong jah xơy tok jêêk poop hnhư danưng kooy, deng ka varơuq dơơp thơy tơơk tưp vah xôq tưp kuah lêh danưng kooy kaxay xuum Kơy Plêêk gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Lunưq, varơuq neq e valơk đom Rahlăp Vah:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“'Yo ne, Gô xôq aduq Si-ôn muuyq kuk phơu muum,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">jah rơơlh xok, thier quiq jaq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Ji kơyq tuôq aduq Kadraq kajưk dik leh biq kamưưl.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Vii anưq, varơuq quiq jaq nưq deng ka oh ay laa khơl adro tuôq. Măn đôôyq dii khơl adro leh tuôq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“Kuk phơu đơu khơl thơq xơy ka'lăk vlôh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">phơu nưq heq jah jêêk vlôh phơu ưk muum hnhư”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />ji laa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">“Kuk phơu dơơp xatôôlh jôôk, kuk phơu dơơp ka talaalh gưlh.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 2:8">Oot xatôôlh gưlh vii leh tameng tyauq apok Lôôk, đơu truh varơuq neq oot kung heq jah đinq 'miêh yôôch. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Bơh oh ay dong adrơơk jah rơơlh xok, laa chưk tơơk tưp hnhư vuua, laa tamooy vah, muuyq tamooy thuôk qwuyen ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq oh ay padoh taboon kaluh varơuq akêh lơyq ku Kơy heq taayh oh ay vlôh klơlh kamơng jaluk muut đom xaraar tađnah akêh ku Kadraq, <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />đơu oh ay adroyq hơq “leh aalq laa muuyq tamooy”, bơh juneq laa “tamooy ku Kơy Plêêk”; laa khơl adro hmưq “leh jah biit angơuq”, đơu juneq heq, “jah biit angơuq”.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Oh ay xung xiaq, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay, đaji khơl tamooy măn xangưưy dêh ji khơl manih hooy ma trôôk, pheq chuh xangưưy kaluh hmưch trôôch xăk xamơk, laa thưq damưq tachơơl hlê dii phool hiel oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />tuôôy jư kach xa măn ku oh ay dong hyioh kaxay đom katul khơl manih daak kadrơy, xôq yôôch, đom varơuq kajoq oot đnooy xơuq truh oh ay đaji khơl adro dơơp xơk, yôôych bơyh 'yo hloq kaluh varơuq kaxay ku oh ay, oot e hnoq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk đom hngơy Kadraq truh hlơq.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Vii kơq Lôôk, dayh tameng tyauq kaluh da uh qwuyen koot manih, e hnoq nưq laa vuua đaji manih adrơk qwuyen kôt yưk, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />long khơl padrok xakaq, đaji khơl manih jah vuua patăk dăt xagook truh varơuq hmơt dook adro dơơp xơk ji varơuq ăm kadrool manih dơơp kaxay. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Vii neq laa iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk: dơơp varơuq kaxay xôq khienq ka khơl koot manih vlô khưrq xa athêêk leh hlolh xet pheq hnhep huuy, <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />đom đơơy riirh đaji khơl adro rayơh rayơơy, ji be xok varơuq rayơh rayơơy ku haay đaji maang đơ ka varơuq xơk, bơh đaji khơl xapok ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Dayh vanê vado tôôy adro. Dayh xung xiaq oh ay haay. Pheq kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk. Pheq vanê vado vuua.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Neq khơl oh ay dơơp xapok, duh tameng tyauq kôôch oh ay dii dêq hloay xuum kuh vado, be aalq vơ adro kôôch tolh ji xuum kaxay tamaq, đơu măn adro kôôch xơk tauq đnoyq. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Vii atoh kơyq chiuq uunq jiq jiêh đom tuôôy hmưq chiuq varơuq leh hyioh jăk vii kơq xuum klaak wih xuq Kơy Plêêk, yôôych nưq laa muuyq vanong kaxay. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />E tơơl dal kajoq atoh lôp kadrôôp yôôch oh ay pheq chiuq biq tiel dook? Bơh atoh dơơp kaxay yôôch oh ay pheq chiuq uunq nhemq xet pơl dal, yôôych nưq laa muuyq vanong kaxay adroyq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Vii oh ay heq jah tawooyh taayh ka varơuq nưq, bơyh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung heq chiuq pơơl thêq oh ay, xôq hlê muuyq ramil ka oh ay xôq ka oh ay e hnoq hooy tyauq tawaak jôôk Kadraq,<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Kơy leh lôp kadrôôp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:22">kung be e apok pa ôôh leq jah axek hloq aduq huuy Kadraq”;<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />laa Kơy tuôôy biq đnooy ra ơơh, Kadraq leh đnooy ra ơơh hlê; tuôôy chiuq pơơl, Kadraq leh naap joa, đơu Kadraq pahnăp xăk ka Kơy xưh xadrah hyioh jăk; <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Kadih Kơy nưq heq pơq kadrôôp maroh haay đom xăk xamơk Kadraq tol gay charăk, xôq atêq tuôôy heq kaxêêt đôôyq dii kadrôôp maroh, haay e hnoq riirh ka varơuq hyioh jăk, gamưh kaluh xưr xôôh ku Kadraq đơu oh ay heq jah payơh. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Vii oh ay 'miêh đaji trưưu biq hyaak, bơh juneq oh ay heq jah wiit xuq dii Kơy xakaq trưưu ji Kơy Jư 'Yo ku phool hiel oh ay.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Wơơy khơl mư laa khơl adro kadrê, kung đanưq, duh tameng tyauq kanau khơl mư, xôq pheq đnooy atoh muuyq sôôq adro kanau leh tameng tyauq đaauq, bơh gamưh kach xa măn ku kadrê ju leh xok apok đnooy, yôôych khơl adro kanau nưq hnoq jah tuôq tyauq, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />atêq tuôôy 'yo hloq đơơy riirh xarêh xaraat kung dii varơuq vado ku khơl mư, <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />đơu tadê rayoa ku khơl mư leh aalq măn pi gôk voot hlôôk ji hlưk đô vajang, long xa vâk qwuân aau karoh kaxay, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />bơh laa xuum klaak koot manih pi'lăp, dii nêêk kaxay măn hloay ku danưng kooy manưl manưưy ji hnhep, varơuq nưq laa quiq jaq adroyq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Vii khơl kadrê vah tuôôy hnu, laa khơl adro xôq xuum takôô gamưh aduq Kơy Plêêk, kung heq ta'meq xăk xamơk đanưq tuôôy tameng tyauq kanau mư, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />đaji Sa-ra heq tameng tyauq apok Ap-ra-ham tuôôy taayh kơy laa lôôk, khơl oh ay kadrê jah jêêk vlôh koot xau ku mo tuôôy dơơp kaxay ji leh kamưưl paq kê varơuq varaal yôq leq.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Wơơy khơl oh ay laa khơl manih kanau, kung đanưq, bơơn varơuq hlolh xet, duh pheq achung riirh dii kadrê đaji dii manih iuq iaq, ka ajơ ahlook aklah varơuq vado đaji khơl kung e phon vanong plêêk ku varơuq riirh, xôq ka apok apôôy ku oh ay leh biq klơl hlê.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Atêq dik, dêq hloay duh e kung muuyq xuum biit, varơuq biit angơuq, xiaq oh ay khơl wơơy, xuum kaxay, varơuq apôôt xăk, <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />te xok xơk bla xơk, long apok karoay axaap tơơl hlê apok karoay axaap, đơu wiit hlê, kưq apôôy kaxay, vii oh ay heq jah taayh truh varơuq nưq, xôq oh ay jah nhonq vanong kaxay. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Vii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">“Kơyq trôôch xiaq varơuq riirh ji hloq hngơy xiêk kaxay tamaq</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">pheq jư kapiet ni klơlh varơuq xơk, ji huuy ni be đnooy varơuq pa ôôh lar.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Manih nưq pheq wih klơlh varơuq xơk ji pheq dưk dơơp varơuq kaxay.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">Adro nưq pheq axek akhiim varơuq tagu ji pheq chawiq tyauq varơuq nưq,<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />vii mot Lôôk măn tol manih hyioh jăk ji tôôr Kadraq măn jeq apok apôôy vôôch ku oot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">bơh mot Lôôk tachơơl hlê adro dơơp xơk.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Kơyq laa adro hnoq dơơp ra ơơh oh ay atoh oh ay jêêk vlôh khơl adro garơng dơơp truh varơuq kaxay? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Lunư, long tabơh oh ay pheq đnooy pheq chiuq pơl vii varơuq hyioh jăk, yôôych oh ay dik e vanong. Panưh kadrơy, te biq varaal hwaal tyauq kamo yôq ku oot, kung te biq xôôl dôôl, <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />đơu dayh vanê vah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa Lôôk đom xuum haay, hloay hloay talăng jăk ka varơuq tơơl hlê dêq hloay kơyq vôôch oh ay kakơq ka xuum takôô gamưh đom oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />bơh dii varơuq tagu ji vado, vii e muuyq xuum klaak kaxay, xôq đom varơuq kajoq đơu oh ay biq đnooy pahnhiq, yôôych khơl adro đnooy ra ơơh đơơy riirh kaxay tamaq ku oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh pheq xơuq kamưưl. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Vii atoh laa iq Kơy Plêêk trôôch, yôôych dong chiuq pơl dơơp kaxay, iaq laa dơơp xơk. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Bơyh vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung heq hmưq chiuq pơl vii kadrôôp maroh — Kơy hyioh jăk kaxêêt thêq adro be hyioh jăk — xôq Kadraq e hnoq jarooy haay truh dii Kơy Plêêk, tuôôy biq kaxêêt truh phon xăk đơu jah dơơp ăm riirh truh phon danưng kooy, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />đom danưng kooy nưq, Kadraq kung heq padoh taboon tuôôy jah truh dii phool hiel đom tu, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />laa khơl adro adroyq hơq leh tameng tyauq tuôôy varơuq atuq xuum ku Kơy Plêêk 'miêh kôô takôô đom đơơy Nô-ê, đong tuôôy poop tau jah đoonq, đơu đom tau nưq, taleq adro — nưq laa thơơm phool hiel — heq jah wơơt klơlh daak, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />đơu neq kung laa long lơuq juneq wơơt xok oh ay, 'ngưq laa pheep bap-tem — leh aalq varơuq tapolh ka'lăk thul 'moh tol xăk xamơk, bơh laa varơuq tavek ku muuyq xuum klaak kaxay deng ka Kơy Plêêk — gamưh varơuq riirh hlê ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />laa Kơy, atêq tuôôy hooy tok tol plêêk, đong 'ngôôy pi akoh Kơy Plêêk, đơu khơl yaak plêêk ji khơl kơy e da uh qwuyen kung kaluh paraat da uh raay tameng tyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Anưq yôôych, vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq chiuq pơơl đom xăk xamơk, lunưq oh ay kung dayh chiuq ralauq palauq kung xuum biit nưq, bơyh adro leq heq chiuq pơơl đom xăk xamơk yôôych heq ka'lăk klơlh dii kadrôôp maroh, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />xôq tuôôt kawat măn hlê đom xăk xamơk, adro nưq paq măn riirh ka xuum hmưch ku koot manih đnoyq, bơh ka iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Vii kawat heq dalơh hlê heq đu xôq jah ik iq trôôch ku tamooy kadrơy, tuôôy riirh đom varơuq xa măn paq xet biit, hmưch trôôch, vuul weel, xa hôôch, xa agưt paq kê ji akuh dang vangưl thier ramêq, <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />đơu đom varơuq nưq, oot biq tưng hưng tuôôy oh ay leh charơơk tyauq oot đom kung alook daak aluulh ku varơuq xa agưt bơyq ba, lunưq đơu đnooy apok katơơk galơh; <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />bing oot hnoq đnooy vlôh apok đnooy padoh kangưưr Kơy ralauq 'miêh xưh xadrah manih riirh hloay manih kaxêêt. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Bơyh vii varơuq nưq, Hêêl Kaxay kung heq jah padoh taboon ka khơl adro heq kaxêêt yôôch, xôq ju oot heq chiuq xưh xadrah tyauq koot manih đom xăk xamơk, yôôych neq oot e hnoq riirh tyauq Kơy Plêêk đom danưng kooy.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Panưh kadrơy, varơuq lôôch dik ku paroh araak heq truh jeq. Vii anưq, dayh luh laak ji talăng jăk tơơk tưp kaluh apok apôôy; <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />tuôôy adroyq dêq e xuum xung xiaq talăng jăk deng ka mamuuyq, vii xuum xung xiaq hnoq katuh galôp viik ngăk kadrôôp maroh; <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />e xuum tiip đoonq dii mamuuyq đơu leh huq phanq nanq; <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />ji tyauq đaji tôôy adro heq nhonq vanong, xok jung ni hơu varơuq ka mamuuyq, dang đaji khơl adro jư 'yo jooy đôôyq dii vanong plêêk 'ngưng varơuq đêh mamuuyq ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Atoh kơyq padoh taboon — yôôych đaji đnooy apok ku Kơy Plêêk; atoh kơyq hơu varơuq — yôôych dơơp varơuq đaji bơơn paraat đơu Kơy Plêêk kahniq ăm, xôq đom kaluh varơuq Kơy Plêêk jah ayuôôt laat gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa Kơy đangq jah tađnah tađnaak ji taay yaak dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Oh ay xung xiaq, te biq tưng hưng truh loo ôôlh rahưk măn katul oh ay, tuôôy xalih vlôh aduq oh ay xôq thưh tôôy, đaji anưq varơuq đêh akêh xalih truh ka oh ay, <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Wih hlê, xatyauq oh ay e phon taleq muut kaluh pơl dal ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych dayh hlah hlaak tanư, xôq ka đom varơuq kahnoq vlôh tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq, oh ay jah ayuch ayauq, viik galaay hlah hlaak. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Atoh oh ay biq đnooy ra ơơh vii yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych e vanong dik, bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel ku varơuq tađnah tađnaak ji ku Kơy Plêêk, măn tol oh ay. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Te e kơyq đom oh ay chiuq pơơl đaji adro păk kaxêêt manih, adro atôk, adro dơơp xơk, long đaji adro xalieh muut varơuq khơl drơy, <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />bơh atoh chiuq pơơl vii laa Manih Tuôq Lôôk Jê-xu, yôôych adro nưq te kamưưl, đơu đom yal nưq dayh ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Bơyh vii heq truh tuôôy xarôp varơuq xưh xadrah xing hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk; đơu atoh adroyq dik xing haay, yôôych varơuq lôôch dik ku khơl adro leh tameng tyauq Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq đaleq?<verse eid="1PE 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ji “Atoh manih hyioh jăk kho jah wơơt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">yôôych manih leh tuôq akuh ji adro e kadrôôp hnoq măn 'leq?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Jo anưq, khơl kơy chiuq pơơl tyauq iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk dayh pahnăp phool hiel haay ka Kơy Panưk Jêêk jư apok đom varơuq dơơp kaxay.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Vii anưq, gô — kung laa khơl draq ji laa adro dơơp xanưk truh kaluh pơơl dal ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kung laa adro e phon tađnah tađnaak jeq jah kahnoq vlôh — ahmưk nhăk khơl draq đom katul oh ay: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Dayh xakaq 'yo bơy de ku Kơy Plêêk măn katul oh ay, dưk dơơp kông varơuq 'yo xiap — leh dơơp kach raanq uunq, đơu dêq xuum dơơp hloh tyauq iq Kơy Plêêk — kung be dơơp dii xuum hmưch trôôch lơy ich bơh dơơp kach dêq paraat hlah hlaak; <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />ji kung leh dơơp đaji laa kơy kôôch dưk xanok khơl adro đơu Kơy Plêêk heq pahnăp, tađôôy muut đnư, laa jêêk vlôh tômq ramil ka bơy de. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy Kơy Xakaq Trưưu Thier Yơơt jah kahnoq vlôh, oh ay hnoq nhonq xok đoat tađnah tađnaak leh hư hlơp. <verse eid="1PE 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Dang đanưq, khơl wơơy blaay lơy, dayh tameng tyauq khơl draq. Dêq hloay pheq hlưp xok varơuq apôôt xăk đôôyq dii mamuuyq, vii Kơy Plêêk tachơơl hlê khơl katơơk galơh, bơh kahniq vanong plêêk ka khơl apôôt xăk. <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Vii anưq, dayh apôôt xăk pôôt 'laarq ti taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk xôq Kadraq tơơk oh ay tok đom kawat ta klip, <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />tuôôy heq pahnăp kaluh lo biit ku haay ka Kadraq, vii Kadraq văch xiap oh ay. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Dayh talăng jăk, dayh rơơt rol. Adro tachơơl ku oh ay, laa kamuuych, dang đaji ôô vomq ook tarok, đong karauq rawiit, axek kơyq nưq xôq kek luôôt. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Dayh tachơơl hlê ni, dưk kajưk đom xuum tuôq, xet đaneq oh ay tuôq Lôôk ku haay tol loch dêh araak pheq chiuq kung kaluh pơl dal đanưq. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Bơh tuôôy heq chiuq pơơl muuyq jơy, Kơy Plêêk ku tôôy vanong plêêk, Kơy heq taayh oh ay truh dii tađnah tađnaak đơơy đơơy ku Kadraq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kadih Kadraq hnoq dơơp xaleep, kung ta'meq, dơơp ăm kalh paraat ji kajưk dik. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Apôôy qwuyen dưk xakaq thuôk truh Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Gamưh Sin-vanh, muuyq adro oh ay muuyq xuum tyauq kach gô 'yo xet, gô heq valơk kach lêq hlê ka oh ay, ahmưk nhăk ji dơơp xanưk neq laa vanong plêêk dong dik ku Kơy Plêêk. Dayh dưk kajưk đom vanong plêêk nưq. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Tayuup vah aduq Ba-bi-lôn, tayuup jah rơơlh đaji oh ay, vôôch hlơq oh ay. Mak, koot kanau gô, kung đanưq. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Dayh vôôch hlơq mamuuyq bơơn kabiin hiip xung xiaq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Apôôy vôôch varơuq hrok hrol măn dii dêq hloay oh ay laa khơl manih đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>